# G6.3 (2026-08-26): Postgres image scan exemptions, each with rationale.
# Review EVERY entry when the image digest is next upgraded (see
# deploy/compose.yaml) — drop the entries that no longer apply.
#
# OpenSSL QUIC-server memory-growth DoS (libcrypto3/libssl3 3.5.7-r0,
# fixed 3.5.8-r0): Postgres serves TCP TLS, never QUIC, so the vulnerable
# code path is not reachable.
CVE-2026-14456
#
# gosu (/usr/local/bin/gosu): Go su-wrapper used only by the entrypoint.
# The full golang CVE set below is local-DoS class in bundled tooling, not
# part of the postgres server attack surface.
