#
# 2026-09-05 (digest ef257d85... refreshed same-day): postgres:17.6-alpine
# base = alpine 3.22.2, which lags the alpine 3.22 security rebuilds
# (alpine-release 3.22.5 / openssl 3.5.7-r0 / musl 1.2.5-r12 / libxml2
# 2.13.9-r1 already in the repo). All rows below are package-level fixes the
# official image build has not baked in yet; the TLS-handshake/QUIC rows live
# on the openssl path postgres exposes only to trusted app servers on a
# private single-tenant LAN (localhost/docker-network binding), and the
# util-linux/zlib rows concern host-side mount(8)/untgz tooling the container
# never runs. DROP these entries at the next official digest refresh once the
# base catches up.
